# Quality Checks

After completing any code changes, run all three checks and fix issues before considering the task done.

## Commands (run in order)

1. `yarn check-format` -- Prettier formatting + Tailwind class sorting
2. `yarn check-types` -- TypeScript type checking
3. `yarn check-lint` -- ESLint linting

## Process

- Run each command sequentially
- If any check fails, fix the reported issues in the affected files
- Re-run the failing check to confirm the fix
- Do not consider work complete until all three checks pass cleanly
- Never skip this step, even for "small" changes
